Package: rankheatplot
Type: Package
Title: Rank-Heat Plots for Network Meta-Analysis with Multiple Outcomes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Felipe", "Paraiso", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "paraisofelipe@gmail.com"))
Description: Draws the rank-heat plot of Veroniki et al. (2016)
    <doi:10.1016/j.jclinepi.2016.02.016>, a circular heat map that shows
    treatment rankings (SUCRA, P-scores and similar) from a network
    meta-analysis across several outcomes at once. Reproduces the look of the
    original rank-heat plot web tool, exports publication-ready TIFF, PNG, PDF
    and SVG files, and ships a 'shiny' app.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    grid,
    rlang,
    scales,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    gemtc,
    netmeta,
    readxl,
    shiny,
    svglite,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
URL: https://github.com/fparaiso19/rankheatplot_
